infographic sequence-timeline-simple
data
  title max-age=60, stale-while-revalidate=300, stale-if-error=86400
  desc Three nested windows: each layer does one job — freshness, then tail latency, then outage survival
  sequences
    - label 0-60s - fresh
      desc Inside max-age. Served directly from cache, no origin contact
    - label 60-360s - stale, SWR window
      desc Past max-age. Served stale instantly while one background refresh runs - no user blocks
    - label up to 86400s - stale-if-error floor
      desc If the origin errors or is down, keep serving the last good copy instead of a 503
    - label beyond the windows - hard miss
      desc Staleness exhausted; the next request must block on the origin or fail loudly
theme
  palette #10b981 #f59e0b #f43f5e
